{"story":{"id":"event-country-1021","title":{"zh":"浪迹星涯：无人机被击毁","en":"Wanderlust: The Drones Defeated"},"category":"stories","kind":"event","image":"art/1847c49a9205c90405fe.webp","start":"country.1022","chapters":4,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"科学家留下的无人机似乎被某个人或者是某个东西击毁了。\n\n我们应该抓住这个机会，寻找有关首席的线索。\n\n一个特殊项目已经添加到情报日志中。","en":"It seems the drones left behind by the Researcher have been destroyed, by something or someone.\n\nWe should seize this opportunity to pick up the Head's trail.\n\nA Special Project has been added to the Situation Log."},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"country.1022","parent":"n0","via":{"hooks":["immediate"],"kind":"entry","source":"events/country_events_2.txt:972","triggers":[{"zh":"由游戏状态触发","en":"Triggered by game state"}]},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"special_projects:ROGUE_SCIENTIST_1_PROJECT","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"OK","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/country_events_2.txt:995"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"country.1025","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_2.txt:194"},"children":["n4","n5"]},"n4":{"doc":"event_chains:rogue_scientist_2_chain","parent":"n3","via":{"option":"OK","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/country_events_2.txt:1047"},"children":[]},"n5":{"ref":"n4","doc":"event_chains:rogue_scientist_2_chain","parent":"n3","via":{"hooks":["immediate"],"kind":"sequence","source":"events/country_events_2.txt:1036"}}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"country.1022","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"浪迹星涯：无人机被击毁","en":"Wanderlust: The Drones Defeated"},"texts":[{"zh":"科学家留下的无人机似乎被某个人或者是某个东西击毁了。\n\n我们应该抓住这个机会，寻找有关首席的线索。\n\n一个特殊项目已经添加到情报日志中。","en":"It seems the drones left behind by the Researcher have been destroyed, by something or someone.\n\nWe should seize this opportunity to pick up the Head's trail.\n\nA Special Project has been added to the Situation Log."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/1847c49a9